The following is the announcement: Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum sent a message of condolences to Mrs. Tith Mealea on the death of her husband
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, on January 9, 2022, sent a message of condolences to Ms. Tith Mealea and her family on the death of Mr. Nhean Leng, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum stated, "My wife and I are very saddened to learn that HE Nhean Leng, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, who is the husband of Lok Chumteav, passed away on Sunday 2 Roch Khe Bos. The year of Karl Chatva Sak BE 2566 is on January 08, 2023 at 19:33 at the age of 72 years due to disease.
Once again, Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum asked for the sacred objects in the world and the merits of the Buddha, the Dharma, the monks to help nurture and take care of the soul of His Excellency Nhean Leng.
