Dr. Sabo Ozano also stated that the 2022-2023 school year can run across the country, mainly due to the country's peace, stability, and better politics, which allows students and students from all over the country to enter. Conduct studies in all bases across the country.
Dr. Sabo Ozano said that the country is peaceful under the beginning, this peace is under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party.
Prof. Dr. Sabo Ozano added that it is under this peace that the human resource development in Cambodia has developed to this day.
