Preah Sihanouk Provincial Governor Urges Technical Team to Accelerate the Repair of Both Dams and Pumps at Anco Company, Kbal Chhay Area
(Preah Sihanouk): For 2 nights and 3 days, from the night of January 7 to 9, 2023, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, continues to lead the direct order to repair the second dam and the third dam of Anco Water Supply Company's reservoir is located in Sangkat 1, Sihanoukville (Kbal Chhay area).
In fact, on the morning of January 9, 2023, Mr. Sim Sitha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation and Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Provincial Governor, continued to lead professional officers and local authorities to the scene to lead this work faster and more Prasit Prasit pumped water to supply to the third station, continue to filter clean water and distribute it to the people in Sihanoukville.
In the face of this work, the provincial governor urged the technical team to speed up the repair of both dams and pump heads, as well as power lines damaged by landslides, to ensure timely response for supply. Clean water in Sihanoukville again.
Please be informed that for the repair of both dams and pump heads as well as the above power grid, the provincial administration has sent technical teams and machinery, divided into teams responsible for divisions and 24-hour activities to Solve problems as soon as possible.
At the same time, the provincial governor would like to call on the people to save money in using water and should temporarily suspend the use of water in case of unnecessary, such as watering grass, watering the garden, etc., as necessary to supply important parts of the family. .
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun said that the water treatment plant at the second dam can supply 3 million cubic meters of clean water. However, due to the collapse of the third dam, one of the two engines could not work because the second dam collapsed and the pump was also there to supply water to the third station. Therefore, the third water treatment station crashed, which was previously operated for use in the city.
He said that normally there are two machines that have to run every day, but due to this problem, only one machine is running the wastewater. Although not enough, but not at all.
He asked for the understanding of the people in the province, while the authorities and the company are also working hard to find a way to repair to work as soon as possible. For example, he consulted with the team and set out a four-way plan at the same time, which will start from today, when the weather is favorable and can see the goal, the expert team will act immediately.
According to the Sihanoukville Provincial Water Supply Authority, the water supply company, Ankouter Supply, is a water supply company in Sihanoukville and partly in Prey Nob and Stung Hav districts in the amount of 74,000 to 80,000 meters. Cubes. This clean water production is in Sangkat Kbal Chhay, Sangkat 1, Sihanoukville. Production has 3 stations.
