Yesterday, ACU received 122 more declarations of assets and liabilities under the two-year regime for 2023
(Phnom Penh): The Anti-Corruption Unit (ACU) has issued a notification on the results of the receipt of assets and liabilities under the two-year regime for 2023, stating that on Sunday, January 08, 2023, yesterday, the Department of Assets And liabilities received a total of 122 asset declarations and liabilities.
As of Sunday, the Assets and Liabilities Department had received a total of 16,552 copies of assets and liabilities, according to a statement from Fresh News.
Please be informed that the working group of the Department of Assets and Liabilities will be waiting to receive the declaration 7 days a week from 1st to 31st January 2023, without any holidays on Saturday, Sunday and holidays from 08:00 am to 05:00 pm. Interior Ministry spokesman: 48 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on January 8 yesterday
(Phnom Penh): At least 48 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on January 08, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on January 9, 2023.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 48 suspects, 17 were arrested in 10 criminal cases and 31 were arrested in 15 drug cases.
