On the morning of Monday, January 9, 2023, the infrastructure development process has begun for the welcome of early 2023. The work to expand and improve the quality of National Road No. 7 from the roundabout of Cheung Prey district town to Kampong Cham provincial town has started. The ceremony will be presided over by Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia Wang Vinthean.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about an hour and a half, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over a Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Expansion of National Road from Skun to Kampong Cham on the Morning of January 9, 2023
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that today he was very happy to jointly open the construction site to expand and improve the quality of National Road 7 from Skun to Kampong Cham.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in late 2022 and early 2023, Samdech and the Chinese Ambassador jointly inaugurated the construction of four roads and bridges.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese government for its significant contribution to Cambodia's development. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to be a comprehensive strategic partner with China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the construction of infrastructure and the discovery of 19 vaccines to give to the people, if not for Cambodia to rely on China, who should Cambodia rely on?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not expected that Cambodia will grow as big as it is now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this section of National Road No. 7 is an important connection not only in Kampong Cham but also to many other provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the Ministry of Public Works and Transport and all relevant authorities for their joint efforts to launch the National Road 7 expansion project.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the policy of water, roads, electricity and human resources that was decided almost 40 years ago is correct and will continue to be correct for the next 30 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on people to get the booster dose to prevent Kovid 19 infection.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has ruled the state for 44 years and has completed almost 38 years of his tenure as Prime Minister.
