The following is the Royal Decree of the King: Important Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of the 44th Anniversary of the January 7 Victory Day
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the celebration of January 7 Victory Day was held in the spirit of always remembering the most precious merits of the heroes, warriors of the United Front for National Salvation, Patriots and the Vietnamese Volunteer Army in the struggle to defeat Overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, liberate the lives of the people.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the celebration of the 44th anniversary of the January 7 Victory Day:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the celebration of the Victory Day on January 7 was held in the spirit of always remembering the most precious merits of the heroes, warriors of the United Front for National Salvation, Patriots and the Vietnamese Volunteer Army in the struggle. Overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and liberate the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the celebration of the Victory Day on January 7 took place at a time when Cambodia was developing and having a high prestige on the international stage.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people are now living in harmony under the shadow of peace and continue to strive to build a society and a hopeful life.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the pain and sorrow due to the brutality of the Khmer Rouge regime continued with the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the January 7 victory closed the pages of the black era, bringing a new era of living, learning, development and giving a second birth to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the day of victory on January 7 only led to Cambodia today. This is an indisputable historical fact. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who did not recognize January 7 Victory Day were the only ones who supported the Khmer Rouge regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from the day of victory on January 7, Cambodia has the opportunity to achieve peace and completely end the flames of war on December 29, 1998 and move towards national development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from overcoming Kovid 19, the Cambodian economy will grow at around 5.5 percent by 2022 and is expected to reach 6.6 percent by 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the spirit of national development, Cambodia has been growing and the salaries of civil servants, the armed forces, pensions for veterans and retirees, the wages of workers in the textile sector have been continuously increased.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the spirit of January 7 continues to be in the hearts of Cambodians of all generations and must hide the spirit of January 7 to continue to be strong. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that January 7 Victory Day turned Cambodia from a land of death to a beautiful land today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that continuing to stand together on the right path will not be able to destroy Cambodia's achievements and efforts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the Cambodian people to unite to protect peace and protect Cambodia's achievements. Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for unity to prevent and eliminate extremist politics. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a decisive change must be made to defeat extremist politics, whether left or right, to ensure peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on those involved in extremist prisoners to withdraw to escape the law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed local authorities to continue to pay attention to strengthening social security and efforts to provide social protection services.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on political parties, civil society, information, ministries and institutions to respect the rule of law, make the election conducted in a good environment, ensure neutrality and transparency.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia adheres to the UN Charter and international principles and strongly opposes the invasion of a sovereign state. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the past experience for Cambodia is to maintain the idea that only negotiations can end the war, can not take the war to end the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has declared his commitment to do everything possible to ensure peace and social development.
