Samdech Techo Hun Sen affirmed that peace, political stability and security, which are the foundation for the development and harmonious living of the people, are protected only by the whole national force, which is strongly united around the Royal Government.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the slogan "Thank you for peace, thank you politics, win-win" has resonated throughout the country and has become the spirit of a strong and vibrant society in the process of building and defending the motherland. If we do not keep the peace, we will not be able to achieve everything today.
