The Minister said that in order to successfully implement the strategic goals of the Royal Government, it is necessary to have and continue to develop three main factors: solid structure, soft structure and human resources.
Regarding the solid structure, the Minister stated that the Ministry of Commerce has paid attention and made efforts to develop by building administrative buildings and laboratories in the middle level and administrative buildings and small laboratories in the provinces that have been To date, 16 provinces have newly constructed buildings.
In addition, there are 9 mobile fuel and food test vehicles and equipment for inspection and analysis in some laboratories.
