For this project, the length of each side of the river is 120 meters on both sides, the total length is 240 meters and the width of the bank is 4 rows of pillars with a depth of 10 to 12 meters.
As a result, the excavation work was done on both sides of the river to enable the machinery to perform the work and prevent it from collapsing again, and the machinery drilled the foundation to inject three pillars.
