The NEC will post the initial voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the voter list on 13 January.
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) informs Cambodians who have already registered to vote to go and check their names in the initial voter list and the list of voters who will be deleted. From the voter list to be posted on January 13, 2023.
The NEC has stated that the posting of the initial voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the voter list is intended for citizens to visit and verify their names and other data in the voter list. Request correction through complaints and / or objections.
Anyone has the right to file a complaint and / or object in writing regarding the initial voter list and the list of voters to be removed from the voter list to the Commune / Sangkat Council within 10 days after the closing date. Published (January 23, 2023 is the last day).
* Complaints may be made about the loss of a voter's name or a name on the voter list, but inaccurate records of relevant data or information he or she provided or the NEC has deleted the name incorrectly.
Objections can be made to any person named on the initial voter list, but that person does not qualify to be named on the voter list and to any person named on the voter list in more than one place.
