(Kampong Cham): The Kampong Cham Provincial Administration said that on January 9, 2023, at 7:30 AM, the Ministry of Public Works and Transport will hold a groundbreaking ceremony for the expansion and upgrading of National Road No. 7 as a four-lane road under the presidency of Samdech Techo. Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in Taing Kork village, Lvea commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province (km 86).
