General Dr. Mao Havanal emphasized that the Civil Aviation Training Center was transformed into the National Institute of Civil Aviation by the Royal Government of Cambodia in February 2022 in order to allow the Institute to conduct a wide range of courses up to the advanced level. Bachelor.
He said he expects the National Institute of Civil Aviation to promote sustainable development in Cambodia by contributing to the development of human resources in the aviation sector and strengthening and expanding domestic and international aviation services in line with International standards.
