The senior minister continued that after the completion of demining work in the Samdech Techo project for complete mine action, Cambodia still has about 587 square kilometers of suspected mines, which Cambodia has ambitions to complete by 2025.
The Australian Ambassador praised the Mines Authority's efforts to coordinate the mine action sector in Cambodia, with many results over the past 30 years.
