This morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, on Saturday morning, December 31, 2022, met with the production team of the film "Son Krom". The light of the full moon.
