(Kampot): Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Kampot Province, initiated the first motorized fishing boat race in the province to celebrate the Global New Year and to create a happy atmosphere for the people. Fishing.
The motorized fishing boat race was held on a 2,000-meter-long beach in Kampot City, a newly created beach by the provincial governor himself.
This motorized fishing boat race is being held for the first time in Kampot province. The two-day fishing boat race starts on the 30th and ends on the 31st of December 2022.
The fishing boat race started on the afternoon of December 30, 2022 under the presidency of Mr. Mao Thunin and was attended by a large number of government officials, the Armed Forces and the people of Kampot province.
According to the boat race organizing committee, there were about 208 boats participating in the race, equivalent to 104 pairs. Among them, 49 pairs of boats compete in the 500-meter distance and 55 pairs of fishing boats equipped with bulldozers compete in the 1,000-meter distance.
Speaking at the opening ceremony in a happy atmosphere, Mr. Mao Thunin highlighted the organization of boat and fishing boat races to celebrate the Global New Year to attract national and international tourists as well as the entertainment of the people in the province. .
In addition, to give fishermen the opportunity to show their identity and work as fishermen, which is an identity for seafarers and also an opportunity for them to enjoy their business.
Not only does it bring fun, attract tourists, show the identity of fishermen, but the organization of this boat and boat race, Mr. Mao Thunin also wants to spread the message to the people to understand the values of peace that Cambodia has achieved for 24 years. This year, under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Mr. Mao Thunin emphasized that "this happiness can work because of peace and also want to inform our parents, brothers and sisters, our fishermen that we are happy with the value of peace." From whom does the price of peace come from? Because Samdech Techo Hun Sen brought his life with difficulty due to his win-win policy, we have a harmonious and happy day. Therefore, parents and relatives join in remembering and maintaining and protecting the peace that Samdech has brought. ”
The fishermen who participated in this boat and boat race program for the first time showed great fun. They said that this event has never been held in Kampot province and they were very pleased with Mao Thunin for initiating this fun event.
Mr. Mao Thunin emphasized that he will continue to organize this event next year and make it bigger this year.
Please note that in order to celebrate the Global New Year 2023, as well as create a happy atmosphere for the people in the province and national and international tourists, in addition to the fishing boat race, the Kampot Provincial Administration has organized entertainment events. More fun. These events include two concerts, Khmer boxing competitions, bokator performances, parachuting, aerial parades and fireworks to celebrate the New Year.
The provincial administration has also organized exhibitions selling various products and food stalls. The National Commission for the Prevention and Suppression of Natural Resource Crimes sheds light on the burning of vehicles that were cracked down on for the destruction of natural resources.
(Phnom Penh): The spokesperson of the National Commission for the Prevention and Suppression of Natural Resource Crimes saw and followed the social media account "Sok Touch" posted on Facebook on December 8, 2022 an article entitled "Car burning "It was not because they were transporting human wood, but because they were the ones who kept both the wood and the car.
Around this point, there were comments in which (76 Comments) the National Commission monitored each comment, and most of those comments were exaggerated, incited, unprofessional and immoral due to unbalanced and truthful comments. Not yet fully understand the laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The means that the National Commission destroyed in accordance with the law in the past were only illegal processing methods for transporting illegal timber and violated the law on road traffic and were not a means that could be used for the benefit of society. Individuals who express their opinions, please consider the knowledge learned before expressing constructive opinions.
