According to Article 11 of the ASEAN Charter, the ASEAN Secretary-General will be formally appointed by the ASEAN Summit for a five-year term, which can no longer be extended, and shall be selected from among the nationals of the ASEAN Member States. Based on the alphabetical rotation of the names of member states, careful consideration is given to integrity, competence, professional experience and gender equality.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng inspected and led the intervention force at the casino fire in Poipet
(Banteay Meanchey): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, this morning, December 29, 2022, inspected and led the intervention force at the location of Grand Diamond Casino in Poipet Village, Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province. The fire started at 11 pm on December 28, 2022.
According to preliminary reports, at least 11 people were found dead and 30 injured in a fire at the Grand Diamond Casino in Poipet Village, Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province. Extinguished yet. This was confirmed by Major General Sithi Loh, Banteay Meanchey Provincial Police Commissioner.
In this operation, Mr. Sithi Loh's direct command force used a total of 360 people, 11 fire trucks. The force is operating to transport the victims to the hospital and continue to search for the victims. The fire broke out at 11:30 pm on December 28, 2022, but the cause has not been officially confirmed.
