On the afternoon of December 28, 2022, Dr. John Narith, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Economy and Secretary-General of the National Council for Social Protection, inspected the progress of the implementation of the cash subsidy program for vulnerable families in Prey Veng province.
Dr. John Narith requested the provincial administration and relevant authorities to check in the communes in each city / district, lest any vulnerable families remain unidentified so that they can receive Get cash support from the above program.
