Huy Sakiel called the former CNRP leader "Hang" because he could not stand their actions attacking him after he criticized monk But Bun Tinh for misconduct in the pagoda. Free Mountain in the United States.
At the same time, Mr. Sakiel told the Cambodian people in the United States to stop believing in the former leader of the former National Rescue Party because they have no day to win.
Mr. Huy Sakiel said in disbelief, "I'm so angry that I came out and said that the Han is not fair. Do not expect the Han to win the election, even if I alone "I can not get justice. I tell the people in my country, I tell my friends in the United States to stop believing in the scammers, how can the government learn to live with them, no one can win."
