(Phnom Penh): Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, received 20 tons of rice from Duke Hy Kimhong, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Golden Earth Group and Ms. San Sotheavin on Tuesday morning. December 27, 2022.
