Samdech reminded that although the situation of Kovid 19 failed to open some training courses, but when the situation improved, the training work returned, which involved the National Police officers who were transferred from the civil service to the ranks. National police force, but not educated. Samdech expressed his pleasure for the continuous training process both at the Police Academy of Cambodia and at the National Police School.
