* Case 1: At 1:00 AM on December 26, 2022 at Borei Keila Building, Building 6, Borei Keila Village, Sangkat Veal Vong, Khan 7 Makara, 11 rooms were completely engulfed in concrete. Meters multiplied by 4 meters, completely damaged daily use materials.
