* Case 2: At 2:30 AM at 171 along Monireth Street, Group 49, Village 16, Sangkat Boeung Salang, Khan Toul Kork, a house was completely burnt down. Multiply by 25 meters, completely damaged the material and spread to 3 neighbors' houses.
The fire was extinguished at 4:00 am on the same day, using 21 Phnom Penh office vehicles, 42 water trucks and 1 ambulance from Cambodia Beer Company. 1 car.
