(Phnom Penh): On Monday morning, December 26, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Mr. Wang Vinthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for the rehabilitation and upgrading of National Road No. 41.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese government for providing credit to improve the quality of National Road 41.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's policy before the low money to make the road long, but now must focus on quality and aesthetics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that National Road No. 41 is a road that has been used since the time of King Ang Duong in the 19th century to connect the capital in Udong to the sea of Kampot province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 41 is an important road connection for the transportation and tourism sectors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen seeks understanding and tolerance from people living on both sides of National Road 41 who will face difficulties during road construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 41 is not a failed achievement but the result of the efforts of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, the Chinese friend has helped build 30 roads with a length of more than 3,000 kilometers at a cost of nearly 2 billion dollars. Among them, there are many roads under construction worth about $ 500 million. Separately, 9 bridges have been built and are under construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the 1980s, Cambodia had four imbalances, including: four imbalances: first, an imbalance between supply and demand, second, an imbalance between expenditure and revenue, and third, an imbalance between exports and imports. , Fourth, income and purchasing imbalances.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the signing of a free trade agreement with China is a great opportunity for Cambodia's agricultural market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the current difficulty of the Royal Government is to find markets for people's products.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highlighted the tricks of the opposition in the referendum on agriculture that when entering the market promises to make rice cheaper and when to promise farmers to increase the price of rice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the RCEP Agreement is a source of pride for Cambodia because it was initiated by Samdech when Cambodia chaired ASEAN and came into force when Cambodia returned to chair ASEAN in 2022.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that before Kovid 19, the Royal Government had a surplus of money (remaining after spending) of not less than $ 500 million. Currently there are about $ 350 million.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to save electricity because the state is currently losing electricity.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that when he went to Brussels, his legs were twisted and he could not rest because the weather was too cold.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on people to respect traffic laws while driving. Do not be afraid of the traffic police, be afraid of loss of life or disability.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Ministry of Education and relevant authorities for organizing the bankruptcy exam successfully.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen told all the bankrupt people that no matter what they get in the case, they should be happy and not pay too much attention to the issue. Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on failed students to continue their studies to take the exam next year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the bankruptcy exam continues to be tightened without any concessions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has done well in education and must continue to promote the quality of education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the people of Kandal, Kampong Speu, Takeo who voted for the CPP and hopes to continue voting.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Standing Committee of the Cambodian People's Party has set a goal to destroy all landmines by 2025.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when the CPP leads the country, people can travel everywhere.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government does not prevent those who insult the Royal Government from visiting the district.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to overreact to the opposition who do not know how to celebrate national achievements. Samdech Techo stated that the achievements of the nation are common, not just the CPP.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to call on people to get vaccinated and continue to work together to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
