Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla continue to meet with workers to show the working policy of the Cambodian People's Party
(Phnom Penh): Mr. You Serey Vuth, Special Task Force of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, and Mr. Phen Phalla, Personal Assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, met with about 500 workers from Din Han factory in Tamnak Village, Sangkat Meanchey 3, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
The meeting with workers on Sunday, December 25, 2022 is aimed at the policy of the Cambodian People's Party, headed by Samdech on creating jobs for the people by promoting the establishment of factories, enterprises and investment attraction. From abroad and so on.
Mr. You Serey Vuth stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen always pays high attention to job creation for the people through the formulation of investment policy to protect the private sector and consider the private sector as an important development partner of the Royal Government. In addition, Samdech Techo always seeks foreign investment. Every time he visits abroad or meets with foreign guests, Samdech Techo does not forget to call on them to invest in Cambodia.
For You Sereyvuth, this investment policy and focus on investment has led to the creation of more jobs for people with better wages year after year.
On that occasion, Mr. You Serey Vuth also mentioned the peace factor. It is this peace that leads to investment and guarantees jobs for the people.
In this regard, both Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla advised all workers to work together to protect the current peace in order to have jobs and improve their lives. In particular, keep the peace.
Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla called on workers to vote for the Cambodian People's Party so that Samdech Techo can continue to lead the country in a position to maintain peace and keep jobs for workers throughout Cambodia.
