This year's competition was attended by a total of 172 national and international players. The competition consists of team events and individual events for men and women.
At the end of the competition, the winners also appeared and received the honor from Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in presenting the awards to the winners.
It should be noted that today's golf event is also creating an atmosphere of friendship and solidarity between golfers. Most of the players who participated in this competition were the leaders of the Royal Government in the ministries, institutions of the state, the provincial governors, as well as the ambassadors / ambassadors of friendly countries in Cambodia.
