(Svay Rieng): Police forces of Svay Chrum district arrested two suspects who stole people's property on December 23, 2022 in Trabek village, Svay Chrum commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province.
Mr. Som Sophorn, Police Inspector of Svay Chrum District, said that during the operation, the police arrested two suspects and confiscated exhibits including: 2 motorcycles, 1 mobile phone, 59 cases of fruit juice and beer and some other luggage. .
