Tomorrow morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen opens the golf tournament "Samdech Techo Award 6" to celebrate the 24th anniversary of the end of the war
(Phnom Penh): On Saturday, December 24, 2022, tomorrow, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, will preside over the opening ceremony of the "Samdech Techo Trophy" golf tournament, which will be held at the golf course. Koul Vattanac Gold Resort.
The Samdech Techo Trophy Golf Tournament was held to celebrate the end of the Cambodian war under Samdech Techo Hun Sen's win-win policy on December 29, 1998, which will last for 2022 years. For 24 years.
This year's competition was attended by a total of 172 national and international players. The competition consists of team events and individual events for men and women.
The competition will take place throughout the morning and in the afternoon there will be an award ceremony for the winners along with a solidarity meal.
In fact, in 2023, Cambodia will host the 32nd SEA Games and the 12th ASEAN Para Games. Cambodia has been looking forward to hosting this regional event for about 64 years. The long anticipation due to the crisis of war made Cambodia lose its capacity and ability to organize.
Therefore, the golf tournament for the Samdech Techo Award not only celebrates the existing peace, but also a message of the values of peace. Peace gives Cambodia the opportunity to build a more prosperous society and also the opportunity for the children of Cambodian investors to build a multi-million dollar golf course to cater to the needs of golf enthusiasts.
Golf events also create an atmosphere of intimacy and solidarity between golfers. Most of the players who participated in this competition were the leaders of the Royal Government in the ministries, institutions of the state, the provincial governors, as well as the ambassadors / ambassadors of friendly countries in Cambodia.
Please note that Vattanac Golf Resort Golf Course is a luxury and famous course in Cambodia located in Sangkat Prek Thmey, Khan Chbar Ampov, Phnom Penh. The Samdech Techo Trophy Golf Tournament has been held at this location twice.
Vattanac Golf Resort is a luxury golf resort just 35 minutes from the center of Phnom Penh.
Both the east and west squares of Vattanac Gold Resort showcase Cambodia's famous culture, architecture and history, such as Angkor Wat, Preah Vihear, Elephant Camp and Bayon.
The east and west pitches are luxuriously built to serve the game. The east and west squares have the same 18 lots.
