Wing Bank officially opens Boeung Trabek and Preah Yukunthor branches, providing more options to meet banking and financial services needs
(Phnom Penh): Wing Bank (Cambodia) CMC on December 23, 2022 inaugurated two new branches in Phnom Penh: Wing Bank Boeung Trabek Branch and Wing Bank Preah Yukunthor Branch, which offer more options. More for Phnom Penh residents to use to meet their banking and financial needs.
The inauguration ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Rath Sovannarak, Assistant Governor and Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, as well as Duke Kith Meng, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Wing Bank and CEO of Royal Group, as well as many other dignitaries.
Mr. Rath Sovannarak congratulated Wing Bank on opening two new branches, which will provide the community with more financial and banking options.
Both branches provide full banking services from 8am to 5pm Monday to Sunday, providing customers with easy and fast access to Wing Bank's high quality financial products and services, even on The weekend.
"And for those who like to do their banking operations at friendly bank counters, we have opened these Wing Bank branches to meet their needs as well," he said. "All Wing Bank branches are equipped with state-of-the-art facilities and special features to provide customers with world-class banking services."
In 2022, Wing Bank has expanded its banking network to seven strategic locations nationwide, in addition to its headquarters on Monivong Boulevard in Phnom Penh's Boeung Keng Kang III district.
Wing Bank Vimean Ekareach Branch and Wing Bank Sen Sok Branch in Phnom Penh opened in March and Wing Bank Sihanoukville Branch on 18 August while Wing Bank Wat Phnom Branch and Wing Bank Toul Kork Branch in Phnom Penh Both opened on August 30.
Wing Bank Boeung Trabek Branch is located along the corner of Monivong Blvd. and Street 432 in front of the Vietnamese Embassy, while Wing Bank Preah Yukanthor Branch is located along Sihanouk Blvd. next to Telecom Cambodia. All branches are beautifully designed with ample parking, lounge cafes and special meeting rooms.
The professional and attentive staff of Wing Bank is always welcoming and ready to answer any customer questions as well as high quality services at design booths. Up to ensure convenience and privacy when customers come to these branches to meet their daily banking needs.
Customers can deposit and withdraw money at all 8 Wing Bank locations nationwide, as well as apply for a loan and check from any bank free of charge. Customers can also use the luxury meeting room for meetings and discussions.
At Wing Bank, customers can consult with a professional business credit staff to open an account, request a bank card, transfer money and access digital banking, as well as many other services available.
The launch of this new branch is a testament to the implementation of Wing Bank's mission to meet the needs of all customers, whether they prefer to use any of their services with Wing Bank digitally or through a direct bank branch.
