Kep Provincial Governor Distributes Relief to Nearly 40 Families in Damnak Chang Eur District
(Kep): Dr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province and Chairman of the Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross, led the members under the supervision and relevant authorities to visit and bring the humanitarian donations of the Cambodian Red Cross with Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun. Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross to provide relief to 37 families affected by the typhoon from Ang Koul and Pong Teuk communes, Damnak Chang Eur district.
The distribution ceremony was held in Angkol commune, Damnak Chang Eur district, Kep province on December 23, 2022.
Donations given to all 37 families, each family received: 25 kg of rice, 1 can of soy sauce, zinc provided according to the size of the damage of each family, a total of 239 sheets and some budget. . Samdech Kittipritthbandit would like to thank His Majesty the King of Cambodia for donating $ 1,000 to the Cambodian Red Cross for December 2022.
