(Siem Reap): The case of a young woman wearing a school uniform who committed suicide by hanging herself in Daun Ov village, Leang Dai commune, Angkor Thom district, Siem Reap province has occurred since 2018 and is not upset because of the exam Bankruptcy was also due to a personal mental crisis.
This is according to the press release of the Siem Reap Provincial Administration issued this morning, December 23, 2022, after a series of cases shared on Facebook, claiming that the young woman hanged herself because she was upset about the exam. Breakdown ever.
