Senior Minister Cham Prasidh Closes the 3rd ASEAN-India Innovation Forum 2022
(Phnom Penh): The Senior Minister and Minister of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation, Mr. Kittisetha Dr. Cham Prasidh, closed the 3rd ASEAN-India Innovation Root Forum 2022, a forum to commemorate the 30th anniversary of ASEAN-India friendship and partnership.
The forum was organized by the ASEAN Committee on Science, Technology and Innovation (COSTI) in collaboration with the Department of Science and Technology (Government of India) and the National Innovation Fund (NIF) of India, held at the Institute of Technology of Cambodia from 19 December 21, 2022
On the occasion of the closing of the forum, Mr. Kittisetha Bandith, Senior Minister, expressed his appreciation that the three-day event provides a forum for all participants to share experiences and the best of innovative roots among the ASEAN and Indian communities.
"I am optimistic that the cooperation between ASEAN and India will expand and we will share a bright future together," said Senior Minister Cham Prasidh.
The forum also includes workshops on innovative roots, innovative roots competition, student innovation competitions and innovation exhibitions with the participation of India and ASEAN member states.
