This highlight was made at the 13th General Assembly to elect the President of the Association and the Board of Directors of the 8th Mandate 2023-2024, which was held at the Sunway Hotel on the evening of December 22, 2022, when Mr. Son Sieb received Support to be the new president of CVEA to replace Mr. Chrek Soknim (out of term) after he led the association for the last two terms.
