(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sou Socheat, Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia (CSX) on December 22, 2022, emphasized that all investments require financial literacy. Things will have to be considered carefully, especially to choose a company that is recognized by the competent authorities.
Mr. Sou Socheat stated, "Every investment requires everyone to have financial knowledge and to think carefully before deciding to invest. Must select a company that has a license or license or recognized by the competent authorities.
