According to the family, when Kim Hong was born, the family was happy and prosperous. When Kim Hong was born, he could read both Khmer and English alphabets, read the Pali script at the age of 2, and read my congratulatory message and condolences to the former King Norodom Sihanouk at the age of three. With no one to teach, Kim Hong can read on his own.
On March 05, 2017, my assistant, Mr. Duong Dara, met Kim Hong in Phnom Penh, taking proficiency tests such as reading my greetings, reading English and taking 4th and 7th grade math tests and using computer research. Google Web Documents.
On July 15, 2017, my assistant visited Kim Hong once again at the Teachers' Residence of Takeo Vocational School, testing Kim Hong's ability in mathematics 10th-12th grade. Kim Hong is only 7 years old and can do homework.
On July 19, 2017, I met Kim Hong and his family at my home, taking math tests and research methods, measuring geographical location, maps on Google maps, and speaking English with my granddaughter. Seeing Kim Hong's high potential in August 2017, my family and I donated a house in Stung Meanchey so that Kim Hong could have the opportunity to continue his studies in Phnom Penh, including some annual stipend.
For general education in the classroom, Kim Hong is assigned to study with students who graduated from 7th grade, ranked 1st to 3rd, and were promoted to 8th grade with a total of 20 students. In his studies, Kim Hong received excellent monthly grades in all subjects, especially mathematics, physics and chemistry.
From the face-to-face test with Kim Hong until he passed the exam at the age of 13 years, 3 months and 6 days, I can say that his grandson Kim Hong is a genius. There may not be many such special people in the world. Kim Hong has more ability than me in computer and English, this is a fact that I have to accept. Based on this special ability, we can estimate that if Kim Hong enters university at the age of 13, he will graduate at the age of 17.
As you stated in 2017, you are responsible for all the achievements of Grandpa Kim Hong, and I wish you success in your studies and in life.
