Mr. Say Sam Al and Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province Distribute Donations to More Than 1,000 Families Affected by Typhoon in Prey Nob District
(Preah Sihanouk): On the morning of December 22, 2022, Mr. Say Sam Al, Chairman of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Assistance Team and Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Provincial Governor and Chairman of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Red Cross Branch Committee, met with the people. And bring emergency relief supplies of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch to the people affected by the strong winds in Prey Nob District.
