Minister Thong Khon sets five recommendations for the Cambodian Tourism Association as an input for work activities in 2023
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, has issued five additional recommendations to the Cambodian Tourism Association (CATA) as an input for the activities of the Association in 2023 and the following year. Make the implementation of the work more successful.
The key recommendations of Minister Thong Khon in the Cambodia Tourism Association's annual Business Meeting Friends and Business Night include:
2: Please organize activities to promote and attract international tourists as soon as possible to capture regional and global market opportunities, while travel trends are still strong, including markets in ASEAN, China and India, etc. Please actively participate in promotion. With overseas partners from activities towards the organization of the 32nd SEA Games and the 12th ASEAN Para Games in 2023 in Cambodia.
