Kandal province is the third province to be officially recognized to end open defecation
(Kandal): Dr. Ouk Rabun, Minister of Rural Development, this morning, December 22, 2022, presided over the official recognition of Kandal province, which is the third province out of 25 provinces to be officially recognized. Complete open defecation (ODF), which means that all toilets will be used by 2022.
