A: The case of the Cambodian People's Party, the Court of Appeal decided:
1: Accept the defendant's appeal in accordance with the law, but rejected it in violation of the law. Receive the appeal of Mr. Plang Sophal, Representative of the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, in accordance with the legal form and legal concept. Exceptions:
B: Case of the National Election Committee of the Court of Appeal:
1. To accept the appeal of the accused in accordance with the legal form but reject it in violation of the law. 3: uphold the Judgment No. 3126 "Ch1" dated 07-10-2022 of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court as an exception, except:
