(Phnom Penh): At least 78 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 21, 2022 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on December 22.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 78 suspects, 16 were arrested in 11 criminal cases and 62 were arrested in 12 drug cases.
