(Phnom Penh): The road connecting Prey Nob district to Sihanoukville with a total length of more than 43 kilometers has been built and renovated under the national budget of about 76 million US dollars. Roads that play an important role in transportation, travel and tourism will be officially inaugurated under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on Thursday morning, December 22, 2022 tomorrow. .
The construction of the two roads began in April 2020 and was completed in August 2022, with a construction period of 28 months, built by China Bridge and Road Corporation (CRBC) and technically inspected by Technical Working Group of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
The construction of these two roads cost more than 76 million US dollars, which is a source of government savings.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, told Fresh News that these two roads are a new achievement for the sacred bond of the Royal Government of Cambodia to the people of Sihanoukville and people across the country. For general and long-term use.
The senior minister said that the two roads are a potential inter-city link connecting the town to the suburbs to tourist areas and natural beaches, as well as connecting to National Road No. 4 Expressway. Fast Phnom Penh - Sihanoukville and all 37 roads in Sihanoukville, Sihanoukville.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol also highlighted that the achievements of these two roads are the result of thinking under the skillful leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister for the benefit of the nation and the people of Cambodia.
Along with the achievement of this road, Senior Minister Sun Chanthol also instructed and asked all citizens and road users to respect all traffic laws, do not drive faster than the speed limit, use the road properly and do not drive. Overweight transportation is required by law to protect life and reduce traffic accidents, as well as maintain the strength and aesthetics of the road for general use for a long time.
