Chao Chak Smok Analyst: Award "Lifetime Achievement of the World's Greatest Leader" Awarded by Samdech Techo
(Phnom Penh): The founder of peace and the Cambodian statesman Samdech Techo Hun Sen received another special award on December 19, 2022, the "Lifetime Achievement Achievement of the World's Greatest Leader" from the Strategic Institute for Asia Pacific (KSI).
This award also recognizes Samdech Techo's dedication to the nation and the people of Cambodia, loyal to the national defense, day and night, without thinking of fatigue and without complaining at all, where suffering is present. Samdech Techo Hun Sen always.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that receiving this prestigious award is a testament to the brilliant success of the Royal Government of Cambodia, especially through the implementation of the "win-win policy". Bring about national unity, peace and political stability.
Since Cambodia became the 10th member of ASEAN in 1999, Cambodia has been recognized as a country that has actively integrated in the region and the world, has built better ties and cooperation with other countries. And has been actively participating in the role of equality and equality in all international affairs, both in the regional and global framework.
The efforts to lead and successfully organize the ASEAN Summit in 2002, 2012 and 2022 are a national pride for Cambodia in the international arena, showing the world the spirit of contributing to building the ASEAN Community and strengthening multilateral cooperation to Peace, stability, security and sustainable development in the region and the world.
"We will continue to make more efforts to develop Cambodia and maintain the achievements that Cambodia has achieved over the past 40 years," he said. "ASEAN-China will continue to build on its achievements as well as enhance cooperation to promote peace, stability and development in the region and the world."
All these wonders under the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister are visible to the world, and through the voice of Tan Srey Michael Yi, President of the Strategic Institute for Asia-Pacific (KSI) also noted the merits of Samdech Techo received Awarded the "Lifetime Achievement of the World's Greatest Leader", stating that this award was given to Samdech Techo for his dedicated work for the people and government of Cambodia as well as ASEAN.
Becoming the Prime Minister of Cambodia in 1985, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is not only the longest Prime Minister for ASEAN, but also the longest Prime Minister for the world.
This year we have seen Samdech Techo Hun Sen lead ASEAN successfully in these difficult and challenging times of the year. Under the chairmanship of ASEAN, Samdech has led the strengthening of the ASEAN Community and the recovery of the economy after the 19 19th Kovid, as well as promoting regional cooperation for ASEAN's digital economy and green economy.
On behalf of the ASEAN Chairmanship, the Prime Minister established and strengthened the close relationship between ASEAN and China, and further investment from China to ASEAN will benefit the region. He added that Samdech has played a key role in not only strengthening and expanding relations with China, but also with the key ASEAN dialogue partners presented at the East Asia Summit.
For outstanding leadership and ASEAN chairmanship, Samdech has become a global leader. Becoming the Prime Minister of Cambodia 37 years ago, Samdech has brought success in economic and social change in Cambodia. Samdech has brought great improvements in Cambodia's infrastructure and made the economy prosperous and modern. This is according to the President of the Strategic Institute for Asia Pacific (KSI).
This is the pride of the Khmer nation and the good fortune of Cambodia with a leader like Samdech Techo Hun Sen who sacrificed everything for the cause of the nation and the people.
With this wise leadership, the people and the world can see that no party can replace the CPP in its core role of maintaining peace, political stability and development.
Receiving the "Lifetime Achievement Award of the World's Greatest Leader", Cambodian Peace Founder Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized: "I hope that the next generation will continue to work together to maintain peace and stability." "Promote national and regional development by building on current achievements."
NEC: Irregularities found by Comfrel were just technical errors but did not seriously affect the election results
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Som Soreida, NEC Advisor and Deputy Secretary General of the NEC, emphasized that the irregularities found by Comfrel were just technical errors in the conduct of polling station officials and the counting of ballots. Lottery only, but it is not an anomaly that seriously affects the election results.
Mr. Som Soreida made this remark during a meeting with Comfrel representatives led by Mr. Sok Sam Oeun, Chairman of Comfrel Board of Directors, on the afternoon of December 19, 2022.
During the meeting, Mr. Som Soreida thanked for participating as an important stakeholder in observing the past election process and submitting a recent report to the NEC.
The meeting took place after Comfrel requested the NEC to discuss further the report on challenges and recommendations related to the 5th Commune / Sangkat Election 2022, which was submitted to the NEC for review.
Mr. Som Sorida informed Comfrel that the 5th Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022 has ended with the acclaim and evaluation from the general public, both nationally and internationally, that this election process took place. To run smoothly in an environment of security, safety and good order in accordance with the laws, regulations and procedures related to the election in force.
He also stated that although the election went smoothly, it could not be considered perfect and the NEC, as a law enforcement agency, was only trying to strengthen its performance. In accordance with the relevant legal provisions in force.
Mr. Som Soreida informed that the NEC accepted the Comfrel report and examined any points related to the competence of the NEC within the framework of its work.
In this meeting, the NEC side also interpreted based on the legal basis to the statement of the Comfrel side, some points such as:
* Arranging for voter registration and overseas voting. At this point, the NEC explained that the NEC has fulfilled its duties respecting and complying with the legal framework that allows the establishment of voter registration and polling stations only in the territory of the Kingdom. Cambodia only
* Regarding the closure and / or closing of polling station windows during the counting of ballots, the NEC shall explain that in accordance with Article 30 of the Law on Commune / Sangkat Council Election, those who have the right can be in the polling station. There are polling station officials, political party agents, observers, special guests and journalists, so closing the polling station is not an anomaly.
* Regarding the request to strengthen the performance of election officials on the record of vote counting (Form 1102), the NEC acknowledges that in the past, there were mistakes of some election officials, but only a small number of them. Cases such as the fact that they did not post this 1102 and so on. That is because they are recruited for the job and receive short-term training. The NEC will do its best to avoid these mistakes.
Capitol Riot Investigation Committee Recommends Charge of Donald Trump for Incitement to Rebellion
WASHINGTON, Jan. 6 (Xinhua) - A US House of Representatives committee investigating the Capitol riots on Monday recommended that federal prosecutors on Monday prosecute former US President Donald Trump for crimes. Four of them include inciting an uprising. This is according to the publication by the AFP news agency on Tuesday, December 20, 2022.
A Justice Department spokesman declined to comment on the request, while Tram's spokesman did not respond to a request for comment.
Putin orders National Security Agency to hunt down traitors (Video inside) (Moscow): Russian news agency reports that President Vladimir Putin has issued an order to strengthen its borders and instructed the National Security Service to increase social control to Defeat traitors, spies, and rebels. This is according to the publication by the AFP news agency on Tuesday, December 20, 2022.
Speaking at a Security Service Day celebration held in Russia on Monday, Putin instructed security officials to strengthen border protection, increase social control and increase the use of their operational, technical and personnel capabilities to prevent risks. From foreign interference in Russia's internal affairs.
"Keeping quiet and mobilizing now is at the request of the anti-intelligence agencies, including the military intelligence," Putin said. It is necessary to crack down on all activities of foreign special services, identify traitors, intelligence agents and insurgents as soon as possible. "Russia's border protection must be strengthened."
Putin also ordered the Russian security services to ensure the safety of people living on the territory of Ukraine, which Russia has annexed and which Kiev and the West consider illegal.
