At the same time, she would like to thank Oknha Ing Bunhou, President of Ing Foundation Design, Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, Deputy Governor at all levels for their cooperation and participation in organizing the Ambok Punching and Kite Flying Ceremony in Kampong Chhnang Province. That confirms the prosperity and development of Kampong Chhnang under the shadow of peace.
