Homeland Fact: Shame and lack of human values of the defeated Sam Rainsy
(Phnom Penh): Through a message posted on Facebook on December 13, 2022, recently, the enemy of the nation, who has the title of a traitorous prisoner named Sam Rainsy, once again misrepresented the masses. With a serious insult to the French president, accusing the French leader of ignorantly cheating the Cambodian Prime Minister by welcoming him as chair of ASEAN.
In fact, the ASEAN Charter clearly states that the ASEAN Chair has a full calendar year, meaning that it runs from January 1 to December 31 of the same year. The handing over of the ASEAN Chair hammer is only a prelude to and symbolic of the closing ceremony of each ASEAN Meeting, but does not constitute an end to the term of office of the ASEAN Chair who hands over the hammer.
Because of this ignorance, three-faced exaggeration and contempt, Sam Rainsy, the three-generation traitor, has suffered only lasting failure as a person suffering from loneliness and suffering. It's crazy to see the glorious Khmer people and the Cambodian leaders have equal honor with friendly countries everywhere.
