The evidence is there, and the victims of this scam have been exposed. Recently, a candle activist named Kong Raya posted on his Facebook page on December 1 that he does politics until he has money. It is likely that the Candlelight Party will have to find politicians who have the resources, while those who do not have the resources will not be able to get a position or be on the list for the upcoming parliamentary seats.
