People who understand and see clearly who are the true patriots and who is with them in all circumstances: Defend the nation, protect the people, increase national reputation and prestige. Moreover, the people have increased their trust in the leaders and members of the Cambodian People's Party in safeguarding peace, stability and development, and serving the people with the utmost sincerity and respect.
