* Mondulkiri, Ratanakkiri, Preah Vihear, Oddar Meanchey and Pailin provinces, minimum temperature may drop to around 15-16 ° C.
* Banteay Meanchey, Battambang, Siem Reap and Stung Treng provinces, minimum temperature may drop to around 17-18 ° C.
* For the capital and other provinces, the minimum temperature is around 20 ° C.
