(Phnom Penh): Dr. Lim Vathana, a kidney specialist and president of the Cambodian Kidney Association, reminded people to be careful in using nutritional products that face kidney problems as the disease is currently on the rise.
Such a reminder from Dr. Lim Vathana was made at the 5th Annual Meeting of the Cambodian Kidney Physicians Association under the theme "Development of the Cambodian Kidney Sector for Growth" on the morning of December 17, 2022 At the Phnom Penh Hotel.
The President of the Cambodian Kidney Doctors Association said, "Kidney disease is increasing every day because the country is peaceful, so the diet is growing accordingly, it is my personal request. "People do not just hear that this is good, that good, some medicine, some traditional medicine has side effects, even my diet does not stop, but please consult with a doctor or kidney doctor before using."
Dr. Lim Vathana added that eating is also an important part of kidney problems, such as sweets, canned goods do not provide much good results, so be careful before eating and at the right level. Avoid causing serious consequences in the future.
