Ministry of Health reveals the results of the official visit of the high-level delegation to Cuba
In a press release obtained by Fresh News on the night of December 17, 2022, it was stated that the visit was to strengthen cooperation in the health sector in accordance with the Memorandum of Understanding between the Ministry of Health of Cambodia and the Ministry of Health. Republic of the Republic of Cuba, signed on September 24, 2022.
In particular, it focuses on examining the possibility of collaboration in medicine (for the treatment of cancer and diabetes, etc.), vaccines (for the prevention of pediatric diseases and Kovid-19), medical equipment, and learning about primary health care. Of Cuba and human resources training in general and specialized medicine.
A delegation from the Ministry of Health of Cambodia visited drug control centers, vaccine factories, pharmaceutical factories, especially cancer and diabetes medicine, hospitals and the Cuban National Cancer Center.
In addition, the delegation also explored and discussed the work of providing primary health care and supply of medicines to pharmacies and to patients in the community of Cuba.
