The handover of the ASEAN Chair, which took place before the end of the calendar year, was merely a symbolic prelude to the closing of the ASEAN Summit, but does not mean the end of the term of the ASEAN Chair. Therefore, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's ASEAN chairmanship began on January 1, 2022 and ended on December 31, 2022.
