Please be informed that in Ratanakkiri province, there are a total of 65,000 hectares of rubber plantations and more than 40,000 hectares of rubber plantations. This is according to Mr. Soy Sona, Director of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Ratanakkiri Province.
