(Kampot): Duke Sok Kong, President of Sokha Hotel, revealed that his company plans to build a huge Buddha statue on the ridge of Bokor Mountain in a 500-meter-high rice field up to 108 meters high. Which will be the tallest Buddha statue in the world.
