Readers' opinion: The special friendship between Mr. Makrong and Samdech Hun Sen is likely to be deeper than what we see!
(Phnom Penh): At the welcoming ceremony for Samdech Hun Sen at the Elysee Palace on December 13, 2022, French President Emmanuel Macron showed a special closeness to the Cambodian leader, which is rare in the history of receiving leadership. Foreigners ago.
If we look closely at the gestures, facial expressions and words that President Macron shows, it is a real heartfelt intimacy, not a performance. As for Samdech Hun Sen, he also showed his heartfelt closeness to Mr. Makrong.
Sources from Paris said that Mr. Makrong, in addition to receiving Samdech Hun Sen as a guest on a state visit, he also showed that Samdech Hun Sen is one of his special guests. In fact, in addition to discussing work, Mr. Makrong gave Samdech Hun Sen a tour of the Elysee Palace, which was like a close and trusted friend.
Sources from the high-level Cambodian delegation also said that Samdech Hun Sen and Mr. Emmanuel Makrong had a very close relationship. The President of France expressed his love and respect for Samdech Hun Sen like a brother.
Through these actions and gestures, it is believed that the leaders of Cambodia and France may have a deeper personal relationship than what has been publicly revealed, that is, beyond the ordinary heads of state and government. .
In fact, Samdech Hun Sen was one of Cambodia's most experienced leaders in the region until Thai journalists called him a "diplomatic elder." This experience is a value that regional and global leaders respect and recognize. Samdech Hun Sen is also a very talented politician in the field of communication, which makes it easy for partners to receive positive signals and throw their hands in a friendly manner.
It is noteworthy that when meeting with a dialogue partner, the Cambodian leader often mentions the special points of the dialogue partner or the special features of the dialogue partner's country. This is the art of diplomatic relations that Samdech Hun Sen has never overlooked.
A special point beyond this is the intelligent political and diplomatic position of Samdech Hun Sen, which is another attraction. In fact, Cambodia's clear stance on the war in Ukraine is one of the most appealing to world leaders. Cambodia has shown reluctance to oppose Russia's invasion of Ukraine and the use of force by strong countries against weak ones.
This position is very important that makes world leaders, especially Western countries, very interested in Cambodian leaders. It is also a political, diplomatic position that benefits Cambodia itself as a small country that does not invade others but does not want other countries to violate its national sovereignty.
In short, Cambodia, led by Samdech Hun Sen, has always benefited from everything, including peace, politics, diplomacy, economics, and the transformation of Cambodia's image on the international stage.
Recently, Samdech Hun Sen received a great honor from the President of France, Emmanuel Macron, through a solemn reception at the Elysee Palace. This is a great honor for the whole Cambodian nation. This honor has humiliated and devalued the extremist opposition group led by Sam Rainsy in the eyes of the Cambodian people as well as the international public.
It is expected that the special relationship between Samdech Hun Sen and President Emmanuel Macron will further enhance the relationship between Cambodia and France for the benefit of both countries and peoples. Do not forget that France is an influential country in Europe, often referred to as the big brother in Europe. By Khmer intellectuals
Cambodia Post launches another branch in Aeon Meanchey to streamline services
(Phnom Penh): Cambodia Post launches another branch in Aeon Meanchey Mall on December 15, 2022 to provide more convenience to customers who need to send goods in and out of the country.
Ms. Khun Tola, Manager of Cambodia Post Branch at Aeon Meanchey Shopping Mall, said that the new branch offers a variety of services such as overseas postage, express postage in the country and all provinces, leaflets and brochures. Other businesses, car rental services, tours, passenger services and money transfers from within and outside the country, among other services.
She said that the opening of branches in Aeon Meanchey will be more convenient for customers who want to send goods in the provinces or abroad after they shop from the market. Need to travel to headquarters. The opening of this branch will further attract more customers to receive services from Cambodia Post.
Cambodia Post will serve customers with quality and responsibility, fast delivery, reasonable prices.
