During the talk, which was the appearance of the district leadership, Mr. Them Sam An also brought a greeting message from Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh. At the same time, the district governor informed the people about the development and progress of the nation's infrastructure, especially Phnom Penh under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
