At the same time, in the third quarter of 2022, the Royal Government paid debt service to development partners totaling 191.07 million dollars, and for 9 months from the first quarter to the third quarter, Cambodia paid debt service to partners. Development of 404.57 million US dollars, an increase of 19% compared to the same period last year, of which 311.67 million US dollars for the bilateral framework and 92.90 million US dollars for multilateral.
