The duke asked the international barcode institution to support the Cambodian barcode institution in terms of technical compliance and standards. The duke also informed about the development and economic growth of Cambodia, including many large companies in the world have come to invest in Cambodia.
Founded on April 26, 1974, Barcode is headquartered in Brussels, Belgium, with 116 offices worldwide, more than 2 million Barcode member companies and technology operations. More than 6 billion barcodes operate every day. Barcode Cambodia became a member of Barcode on December 1, 2003 and is the 100th member of this international barcode institution.
