Makrong also recalled the signing of the 1991 Paris Agreement on Peace in Cambodia to ensure Cambodia's sovereignty and territorial integrity for the reconstruction of Cambodia.
While reminding Cambodia of its support for the peace process in the past, the French President also expressed his gratitude and admiration for Samdech Techo's courage in the war in Ukraine.
"While the war is raging in Europe, Samdech has decided to come to Paris to attend a conference on the support of the people of Ukraine within the framework of the continued implementation of UN resolutions condemning the atrocities," he said. Russia's persecution and to maintain lasting peace. I would like to thank Samdech Chea Oularik. ”
The President also highlighted that the meeting with Samdech Techo Hun Sen also allowed the two sides to discuss cooperation within the framework of the Indo-Pacific Strategy.
In a statement during the press conference, Mr. Makrong also praised Cambodia for its commitment to combating climate change.
"I would have made a loophole if I had not welcomed Cambodia's ambitions on climate change, aiming to be carbon neutral by 2050," he said. "This is a remarkable example of a country managing a fast development with a great energy policy in mind."
In this press conference, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked France for its significant contribution to the process of peace building and development of Cambodia until now. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked the President for the French government accepting the Cambodian people fleeing the war and the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
"Our progress cannot be separated from the French support," he said.
During the press conference, Samdech Techo informed the French President about the discovery of the Cambodia-France Friendship Statue and plans to rebuild it in front of the French Embassy in Phnom Penh.
According to Samdech Techo, this statue was found three days before Samdech Techo's trip to France. The statue was built in 1925 and was demolished by the Khmer Rouge in 1977.
"I have already agreed with the Minister of Lands and Urban Planning that we will rebuild this statue, which is a symbol of solidarity between France and Cambodia, and put it in front of the French Embassy," he said. "Hopefully the president does not oppose this project."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also proposed the resumption of talks to set a clear date for the establishment of diplomatic relations between France and Cambodia.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen highlighted Samdech's predictions related to the World Cup. Samdech Techo told the President about the expectation that France will win the title and Samdech Techo also wished France to win the 2022 World Cup.
