In a meeting with Cambodians from other countries in Brussels, Belgium on the night of December 12, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that although Cambodia implements a free market economy mechanism, but this prevention Is to avoid taking the opportunity to steal prices.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "The Ministry of Commerce will not allow you to raise oil prices arbitrarily. This time, the Royal Government, despite the market economy, must have a guideline, otherwise take the opportunity of oil. "Rising oil prices, lower prices, let's raise."
These fluctuations in oil prices are not unique to Cambodia, they are fluctuating globally due in part to the effects of the Russia-Ukraine war. According to what the prince asked the people living in France, the price of oil there is 1.8 euros, equivalent to about 7,500 riels.
Please be informed that the Ministry of Commerce on December 11, 2022 issued a notification to announce the retail price of fuel at various stations, from today to December 20, 2022 to sell regular gasoline at 4,100 Riel and diesel are sold at 4,250 riel per liter. According to the notice, the price of gasoline decreased by 100 riel and diesel by 200 riel compared to 10 days ago.
The Ministry of Commerce claims that in order to facilitate the livelihood of the people and with the contribution of the fuel distributor in Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has decided to reduce the retail price of fuel in Cambodia by $ 6.5 cents per liter. .
In addition to raising the issue of oil prices, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also highlighted the cost of using electricity, claiming that the Royal Government did not raise electricity prices despite the state's losses.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister saw that if the Royal Government raises the price of electricity, it will be very dangerous for the livelihood of the people who are declining income, transportation costs increase, and what is worse, the factories have to pay more. Therefore, Samdech advised EDC to keep the price the same.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also said that according to the calculations in 2022, Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) lost about 100 million dollars due to the Russia-Ukraine war and sanctions to the world energy crisis.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's keynote speech: Opportunity to meet with Cambodians living in Europe
(Brussels, Belgium): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen met with Cambodian people, students living and studying in European countries to express their condolences as well as social developments.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the meeting with the people of Europe was not a coincidence but a voluntary and agreed arrangement to meet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the language of bidding or renting to meet with Samdech should be terminated. This term is a violation of the right to freedom of conscience.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed outrage at the residents of a democratic country, but used the word buy, rent or oppress for the meeting between Samdech and the Cambodian people in Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted to know how many people protested against Samdech on December 14 at the request of the opposition.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted to see the protesters in Europe against Samdech Klahan to lead the demonstration directly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people and students for sending a message welcoming Samdech to visit Brussels.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen shares his condolences and condolences with the Cambodian family in Europe whose members lost their lives due to Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Cambodians in Europe that fighting Kovid 19 was not an easy task for poor countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Western press despised poor countries, including Cambodia, in their work to fight Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the fight against Kovid 19 does not depend on the modern or weak health system, but depends on management measures.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 19 measures to combat measles that Cambodia has used include health measures (3, 3 preventive measures) and vaccination measures. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is poor, but Cambodia has tried to protect the lives of its people by providing vaccines to people free of charge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that vaccination in Cambodia uses the flower approach, not the equity approach. Using an equity approach does not create resilience.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 19 epidemic of Kovid has led to great concern for the Royal Government on the failure of students to study. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 crisis has put the digital system in the education sector up to 10 years ahead of schedule.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the 19 epidemic of Kovid, the Royal Government released $ 40 million a month to support about 700,000 families.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the 19-Kovid epidemic, the Royal Government released more than $ 2 billion in savings to fight the 19 Kovids and solve the problems of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that overcoming Kovid 19 will enable Cambodia to host the ASEAN Summit and related meetings directly after a two-year absence.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked which US presidents took selfies when visiting a country?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that taking selfies between the President of the United States and the people of Cambodia during the ASEAN Summit is an expression of confidence in the safety, security and disease of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the 19 epidemic of Kovid, the capacity of doctors improved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2022, Cambodia will receive about 2 million international tourists and about 10 million domestic tourists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 2023 election is a demonstration of the regular functioning of the democratic process.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the political maturity of the Cambodian people will be better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised all Cambodian officials for their efforts to facilitate the ASEAN Summit. Despite the complexities, 101 documents were eventually released. Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the security during the ASEAN Summit without any incident.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Myanmar's problem needs at least another five years to be resolved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 issue is not over and will continue to work on health and economic interventions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the war between Russia and Ukraine has become a war between Russia and Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government does not increase the price of electricity to prevent losses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised the Ministry of Commerce not to increase fuel prices arbitrarily.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economy is facing two pressures: Kovid 19 and inflation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government will continue to intervene to help about 700,000 families affected by 19 Kovid and another 600,000 families affected by inflation and floods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2023, the Royal Government will increase the salaries of retired civil servants, veterans and the armed forces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells Mr. Sorn Dara to stop his erroneous analysis. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that FUNCINPEC dissolved because it used bad children like Kem Sok.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told analysts not to expect Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng to seize Samdech's power. Samdech Techo Hun Sen told foreign analysts that if you are stupid, do not pretend to be wise. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said it was unfortunate that the opposition in Cambodia was too bad.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that another bridge will be built to connect to Lvea Em to connect with the expressway from Phnom Penh to Bavet. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of a bridge across the Mekong River in Kratie province could take place on January 2 or 6.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen paves the way for Cambodians abroad who excel in sports to participate in the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that it was not wrong for Germany to arrest those who tried to stage a coup, so there was nothing wrong with Cambodia arresting people who wanted to arrest Samdech.
