(Phnom Penh): At least 44 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 12, 2022 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on December 13.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 44 suspects, 15 were arrested in nine criminal cases and 29 were arrested in seven drug offenses.
