Cambodia is backed to participate in the sailing competition for the members of the most beautiful beach club in the world by the end of 2023
(Sihanoukville): The most beautiful beach club in the world has supported Cambodia, which is also a member, to participate in the sailing competition for the members of the world's most beautiful beach club in 2023, with plans to start From November 14-18, 2023.
In the International Conference on Coastal Development and Conservation of the Conference of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World on the afternoon of December 11, 2022 at the Independent Hotel in Sihanoukville, Mr. Thong Rathsak, Acting President of the Cambodian Sailing Federation The team of the Sailing Federation of Cambodia also participated in this conference.
According to Mr. Thong Rathsak, this event is also to promote the tourism potential and new infrastructure of Sihanoukville, which can attract international tourists to visit the coastal areas of Cambodia.
(Sihanoukville): Cambodia led a delegation of the world's 130 most beautiful beach clubs to visit the community of Peam Krasop Natural Reserve in Koh Kong province, the largest mangrove conservation area, and continued its journey. Visit Thansur Beach, Koh Rong City, Sihanoukville Province to learn more about the development of Cambodia's coastal areas.
The visit took place on December 12, 2022, in the morning, the delegation of the most beautiful beach club in the world traveled by bus to visit Peam Krasop, Koh Kong province under the leadership of Mr. Ny Phally, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism and Mrs. Mithona Phuthong, Governor of Koh Kong Province, and on the day of the delegation returned to Thansur Beach with a welcome from Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Mr. Mang Sineth, Governor of Sihanoukville.
On Paradise Beach, delegates organized presentations, exchanging experiences between the tourism community, coastal development, as well as other information.
Minister Thong Khon said that arranging a visit to the delegation of the most beautiful beach club in the world so that the delegation of the beach club can study, understand and visit directly from the mangrove forest, which is a large fish sanctuary. And the largest mangrove forest in Asia, accompanied by beautiful scenery of Cambodia's mangrove forest.
