Ek Buntha, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Cultural Technology of the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts, said that the 3rd National Short Film Festival of Cambodia, which is scheduled to be held next week, is an important and necessary event to motivate young people to Sharing ideas, sharing the information they have on the screen or whiteboard is the first step in leading them to become filmmakers.
