First, big success is born of many small successes combined. Second, hard work, perseverance is the key to success. Third, success can take a long time, so it requires Patience and Fourth: Set clear goals and keep moving forward until you can achieve your goals, despite the many challenges along the way, and sometimes even repeated failures.
