Teachers at Hun Sen High School in Mondulkiri submit a letter of intervention to the Minister of Education after dissatisfaction with the leadership of the director and change the candidacy of the new Deputy Director of Administration
(Mondulkiri): Academic staff of Hun Sen High School, Mondulkiri, submitted a letter of request for intervention from Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, expressing dissatisfaction with the leadership of Mr. Khuth To, the school principal, and requesting to hold an election. The new Deputy Director of Administration, in addition to Bun Panha, asked for the participation of teachers and the announcement of the results directly.
In a letter of intervention to the Minister of Education, obtained by Fresh News this morning, December 12, 2022, the academic staff of Hun Sen High School, Mondulkiri, claimed that Mr. Bun Panha was not self-selected by Mr. Khuth To. Ask staff advice or vote in any procedure.
