The most beautiful beach club in the world was founded in 1997 in Berlin, Germany. The club is currently headquartered in Venice, France and has 44 member beaches in 26 countries. Cambodia was included as a full member of the Club of the Most Beautiful Beaches in the World at the 7th General Assembly of the Club on May 26, 2011 in Tobago, Senegal.
