(Preah Sihanouk): Mr. Koam Sokhom, Director of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Preah Sihanouk Province, led the branch staff and volunteers of the Cambodian Red Cross in cooperation with the Road Traffic Officer of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police to educate and disseminate the road traffic law. People traveling through various traffic lights in Sihanoukville on the morning of December 9, 2022.
