(Preah Sihanouk): On the morning of December 10, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the opening ceremony of the 16th General Assembly of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World. The ceremony took place at Sokha Beach Hotel in Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province.
After becoming a member of the most beautiful beach club in the world in 2011, Cambodia hosted this convention in 2013 at Thansur Bokor Resort in Kampot Province.
Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, said that seeing the opportunity to promote tourism potential to the world by hosting the 2018 Conference of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the world, Samdech Techo Hun Sen The Prime Minister of Cambodia has allowed the Ministry of Tourism to apply for the right to host the General Assembly again.
At the request of Cambodia, the 14th General Assembly of the Club, held in the coastal city of Toyama, Japan in 2019, also voted unanimously to grant Cambodia the right to host the second General Assembly in 2022 after Check out Cambodia successfully hosted in 2013.
The 16th General Assembly of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World, held in Cambodia, lasts for about 6 days from 9 to 14 December 2022. The conference is organized under the theme "Beach of Peace, Beach of Hope".
The Minister of Tourism said that the introduction of this topic is in line with the current situation where the whole world is facing many global crises in addition to the 19-crisis crisis, especially the Russia-Ukraine war. Significant influence on the world in terms of economy, social development and world order.
The Minister added that the theme is also relevant to the Cambodian context, where peace has played an important role in the development of the country, creating a strong hope for the people as a whole. In this sense, peace is absolutely indispensable for supporting the development of the nation, while many hopes for the future are creating more opportunities starting from this peace.
Mr. Thong Khon said that as the host of the General Assembly, Cambodia will share its experiences and best practices to all club members and the world, both in the management and development of coastal areas. Out of the peace they rarely find with optimistic hopes as a justification for the future.
Minister Thong Khon also expressed the expectation that through the visit to the tourist destination by the delegates of the club member countries, it will also help promote Cambodia's tourist destination to the world because the most beautiful beach club Globally, there are members, there are media, as well as an agency to effectively guide and point out tourists.
