Police said that after the suspect killed his wife and escaped until more than 11 am on December 9, 2022, was informed that the suspect traveled by bus from Pursat to Phnom Penh. Coalition forces ambushed at National Road 5, Prak Kdar village, Vihear Luong commune, Ponhea Leu district, Kandal province, and brought them to the Criminal Police Department.
