He instructed the trainees who have just completed the training to jointly evaluate all aspects, positive results, experiences and challenges caused by landmines in order to strengthen the capacity of trainees to have professionalism, knowledge and practical skills for responsibility. Be on hand to fulfill this humanitarian task.
