Mr. Mak Horn and his wife added that he was surprised by the development of Cambodia in general, and Svay Rieng, in particular, is a province with great potential for these industrial plants, which proves the opposite of Criticized by unscrupulous people who always accuse Cambodia of being a dictatorship, oppressing freedom and being a poor country.
