Mr. Eang Sophalleth said that after the announcement of the flower, many people came to get flowers. Within two hours, more than 20,000 clusters of flowers were distributed to those wishing to continue planting.
Along with announcing the flowers, Mr. Eang Sophalleth also shared how to grow this flower.
