(Siem Reap): On December 8, 2022, the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Siem Reap Province celebrated the International Day of Volunteers on December 5, 2022 under the theme "Solidarity through Volunteer" with the participation of Ms. Sok Naro Chairman of the Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross and Mr. and Mrs. Members of the Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross, Sub-branches, Municipalities and Districts, as well as more than 100 Cambodian Red Cross volunteers and youths.
