Ms. Sok Naro deeply appreciated the leading efforts of all the volunteers who donated resources, time, physical and mental strength from a purely humanitarian heart to contribute to helping the most vulnerable and vulnerable people in the community and At various educational institutions.
In particular, the International Day of Volunteers, December 5, 2022, under the theme "Solidarity through volunteering" for the future, all continue to act non-stop. This topic aims to call on the youth and volunteers of the Cambodian Red Cross, the public and the compatriots to continue to be more actively involved in the responsibility of preventing Kovid-19 epidemic.
